# HindiFlickr30K — IAA and Morphological Tagger

This repository contains inter-annotator agreement analysis and Hindi morphological tagging resources for HindiFlickr30K.

## Contents

- `FleissKappa_Calculation.ipynb` — computes Fleiss’ kappa from three annotator rating sheets.
- `HindiFlickr30K_IAA_Annotator1.xlsx`
- `HindiFlickr30K_IAA_Annotator2.xlsx`
- `HindiFlickr30K_IAA_Annotator3.xlsx`
- `kappa_results.csv` — final agreement results.
- `Morphological_Tagger.ipynb` — trains and evaluates the Hindi morphological tagger.
- `MORPH_TAGGER_REPORT_UD_ONLY.md` — tagger evaluation report.
- `LICENSE.md` — licensing information.

## Annotation Agreement

Three annotators rated 500 captions on five criteria using a 1–3 scale:

- Visual_Relevance
- Semantic_Adequacy
- Grammaticality
- Fluency
- Factual_Consistency

All 500 records were complete and used in the final calculation.

| Criterion | Fleiss’ kappa |
|---|---:|
| Visual_Relevance | 0.8469 |
| Semantic_Adequacy | 0.8328 |
| Grammaticality | 0.8489 |
| Fluency | 0.8404 |
| Factual_Consistency | 0.8494 |

Fleiss’ kappa treats the 1–3 ratings as nominal categories. Ordinal agreement statistics may be reported as a complementary analysis.

## Morphological Tagger

The tagger uses `google/muril-base-cased` and is trained on UD Hindi HDTB. It predicts:

- UPOS
- Gender
- Number
- Case

It also produces a 128-dimensional morphology embedding. No gold tags are used at inference time.

| Task | Accuracy |
|---|---:|
| UPOS | 0.7869 |
| Gender | 0.9559 |
| Number | 0.9596 |
| Case | 0.7428 |

